1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
His wine said nineteen forty-five. It wasn't even made until nineteen eighty-two.

2
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:09,540
So who does that? A guy named Rudy Kurniawan, a wine collector in California.

3
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:15,160
See, rare old wine gets sold at auctions, where rich people outbid each other for one bottle.

4
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:19,320
In two thousand six, his collection sold for about thirty-five million dollars.

5
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:23,640
That's a thousand bucks a day for ninety-five damn years.

6
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:25,900
Double-tap if your wine comes in a box.

7
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:28,620
One of his sales even set a damn world record.

8
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:32,500
Then a New York auction listed his bottles of one French wine.

9
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,000
Some of the labels said nineteen forty-five.

10
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:38,340
But the guy whose family actually makes that wine objected.

11
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:39,980
They didn't start making it until nineteen eighty-two.

12
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:45,140
So the label was thirty-seven years older than the wine. Dumbass.

13
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:47,100
Send this to your wine-snob friend.

14
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:52,460
In twenty twelve, the FBI arrested him at home, and prosecutors called it a wine factory.

15
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:56,680
They said he mixed old wine with newer wine, then poured it into old bottles.

16
00:00:56,680 --> 00:01:00,480
Then he stuck on a label, and there were thousands of labels in there.

17
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:04,900
A billionaire told the jury he paid over two million dollars for fake bottles.

18
00:01:05,320 --> 00:01:06,740
That's almost ten grand a bottle.

19
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:09,340
Follow along, because the bill came due.

20
00:01:09,820 --> 00:01:11,420
A jury convicted him of fraud in twenty thirteen.

21
00:01:12,620 --> 00:01:14,460
He was sentenced to ten years in prison.

22
00:01:14,460 --> 00:01:17,560
And he had to pay back over twenty-eight million dollars.

23
00:01:18,460 --> 00:01:22,120
His wine said nineteen forty-five. Would you have checked the damn label?

